{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30808","headline":"湘川吊舜 · 马戴","name":"湘川吊舜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伊予生好古，吊舜苍梧间。\n白日坐将没，游波凝不还。\n九疑云动影，旷野竹成班。\n鴈集蒹葭渚，猨啼雾露山。\n南风吹早恨，瑶瑟怨长闲。\n元化谁能问，天门恨久关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}